## Errors (3) — must fix before build

### E1. S6.C1 note slide-ref out of range  [error]
- File: `course/sections/06-separating-events-from-effects/classes/01-event-vs-effect-mental-model/note.md`
- Slide count: 7. Note references `[slide 11]`.
- Fix: Renumber the late-stage callout (line ~44, "버튼 클릭 시 fetch도 하니까 effect로 옮겨야지" 함정) to fit within 1–7, OR add a slide for that beat. Likely a copy-paste artifact from an earlier draft.

### E2. S6.C2 note slide-ref out of range  [error]
- File: `course/sections/06-separating-events-from-effects/classes/02-useeffectevent-extract-nonreactive/note.md`
- Slide count: 8. Note references `[slide 9]`, `[slide 10]`, `[slide 12]`, `[slide 13]`.
- Fix: The note enumerates the lint-suppress antipattern, naming antipattern (`onMount`), and decision procedure as additional beats. Either:
  - (preferred) renumber refs to 7/8 — collapse the four off-by trailing refs onto existing summary slides, OR
  - extend slide.source.md by 5 slides if those beats deserve their own visual.

### E3. S6.C3 note slide-ref out of range  [error]
- File: `course/sections/06-separating-events-from-effects/classes/03-effect-event-limits-and-antipatterns/note.md`
- Slide count: 7. Note references `[slide 11]`, `[slide 13]`, `[slide 14]`.
- Fix: This class enumerates 4 constraints + 2 antipatterns ⇒ 6+ content slides. Either trim the note's two trailing antipattern beats to fit existing slides, or add the missing slides. Renumbering alone is the lower-cost fix.

