## Warnings (0) and Info (1)

### I1. Speakable terminology mixing  [info]
- Notably `S4.C2` and `S7.C1..C4` transcripts use English API identifiers (`useEffect`, `useEffectEvent`, `setCount`, `createConnection`) as bare words. `S4.C2` mixes Hangul transliteration (`유즈메모`, `유즈이펙트`) and English in adjacent lines.
- Not a blocker — TTS gpt-4o-mini-tts handles both. Optional polish: pick one style per class.

