## Decision rule applied

- pass ≤ 0 errors AND ≤ 5 warns
- **revise = 1–3 errors** ← this run (3 errors, 0 warns, 1 info)
- fail = structural problems

3 errors localized to one section's note files → **revise**, not fail.
